stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ReadRuleSets
  ReadRuleSets --> CaptureSources: selected RuleSet JSON is valid
  ReadRuleSets --> Refused: invalid fields or version
  CaptureSources --> ValidateRuleLines: referenced sources captured
  CaptureSources --> SourceFailure: unavailable or changed bytes
  ValidateRuleLines --> Refused: invalid, empty or duplicate definitions
  ValidateRuleLines --> Admitted: all selected definitions valid
  Admitted --> [*]
  Refused --> [*]
  SourceFailure --> [*]
